	(text "THE REAL-TIME CLOCK ON PORTS 6 AND 7" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "22411891-5aec-5d97-8cb6-de52a710c45f"))
	(text "IC15, a DS12885: a write of port 6 is the register number (AS, taken as it falls), port 7 that register's data\n(the chip's DS and R/W in Intel timing: MOT low). -CS low, -RESET high. Y1 32.768 kHz, 6 pF; BT1 a CR2032.\nJP8 puts the chip's open-drain -IRQ on the bus -INT. JP9, fitted with the power off, clears the chip's RAM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4bab55ce-e508-5195-9696-19021686dbb3"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
